{
  "format": "camping-intro-presets-v1",
  "usage": "These are module-relative templates, not a renderer timeline. Fill text slots, remove unknown optional layers, assign unique ids, add the chosen module start time to at, and adapt positions to actual 4:3 footage. Copy only resulting layer objects into timeline.overlays.",
